  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/banner.gif\" alt=\"Harvest with ease banner\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=26.1&g=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-5.svg\" alt=\"1.21.5\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-4.svg\" alt=\"1.21.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-3.svg\" alt=\"1.21.3\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-4.svg\" alt=\"1.20.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-2.svg\" alt=\"1.20.2\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-1.svg\" alt=\"1.20.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.19.4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-4.svg\" alt=\"1.19.4\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?version=1.19.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-19-2.svg\" alt=\"1.19.2\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"Loader\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Separator\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/harvest-with-ease/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/server.svg\" alt=\"Overlay\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"Issues\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>描述</strong></h2>\n<p>厌倦了一次次地破坏和重新种植作物？<br>\n<strong>Harvest With Ease</strong>（輕鬆收穫）讓你可以<strong>右鍵點擊</strong>完全成熟的作物，<strong>立即收穫並重新種植</strong>——再也不用進行繁瑣的重新種植了！</p>\n<p>它與<strong>原版作物</strong>和<strong>大多數模組作物</strong>即插即用，讓你能夠放鬆心情，享受無需重複勞動的農耕體驗。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>💡 <em>注意：雖然該模組僅在伺服器端運行，但未安裝該模組的客戶端在手持方塊進行收穫時可能會出現視覺故障（方塊閃爍）。要避免此問題，請在配置文件中將 <code>require hoe</code> 設置為 <code>true</code>。</em></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftstorage.com%252fmods%252fharvest-with-ease%253fref%253dcrystal-nest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/minecraft-storage-banner.png\" alt=\"Minecraft Storage\"></a></p>\n<h2>✨ <strong>功能</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ <strong>右鍵點擊收穫與重新種植</strong>——兼容<strong>原版</strong>和大多數<strong>模組</strong>作物！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/wheat.gif\" alt=\"Harvesting wheat\"></li>\n<li>🍫 也支持<strong>地獄疣</strong>和<strong>可可豆</strong>！<br>\n<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/cocoa.gif\" alt=\"Harvesting cocoa\"> <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/harvest-with-ease/wart.gif\" alt=\"Harvesting nether wart\"></li>\n<li>🌱 自動消耗 1 個作物以模擬重新種植。</li>\n<li>✨ <strong>支持幸運附魔</strong>——使用帶有幸運附魔的物品可獲得額外掉落！</li>\n<li>⚙️ <strong>高度可配置</strong>——根據你的遊戲風格進行調整（見下文！）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>⚙️ <strong>配置</strong></h2>\n<p>通過以下設置自定義你的農耕體驗：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>與模組作物的兼容性。</li>\n<li>遊戲平衡性，例如是否需要工具或限制多次收穫。</li>\n<li>多方塊收穫行為的微調。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>📖 查看<a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/harvest-with-ease/wiki/End-user-configuration\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">專用 Wiki 頁面</a>以獲取詳細信息！</p>\n<h2>🔗 <strong>依賴項</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">模組</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">載入器</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cobweb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cobweb</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">所有</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge Config API Port</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Fabric; Forge ≥ 1.20.2</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">必需</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>📜 <strong>許可證和使用權</strong></h2>\n<p>歡迎在任何整合包或視頻中使用本模組，只需確保提供署名並鏈接<a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a>。<br>\n本項目發布於 <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/harvest-with-ease/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crystal Nest Community License v1</a> 許可證下。</p>\n<h2>💻 <strong>給開發者</strong></h2>\n<p>默認情況下，任何繼承自 <code>CropBlock</code> 的作物都會自動與本模組兼容——無需額外步驟！<br>\n如果你的作物<strong>沒有繼承 <code>CropBlock</code></strong>，你仍然可以通過 <code>crops</code> 配置選項來支持它們。只需確保：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>該方塊有一個名為 <code>\"age\"</code> 的整數屬性  </li>\n<li>該屬性代表從 <code>0</code> 到最大值之間的生長階段</li>\n</ul>\n<p>自<strong>v9.0.0</strong> 起，可以通過方塊標籤來屏蔽特定作物。</p>\n<p>📚 完整的集成指南可在 <a href=\"https://github.com/Crystal-Nest/harvest-with-ease/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a> 上找到。</p>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>支持我們</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Crystal Nest Website\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcrystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Ko-fi\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/kofi/kofi512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><img alt=\"Our other projects\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252forganization%252fcrystal-nest\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Modrinth\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/modrinth/modrinth512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crystalspider/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"CurseForge\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/curseforge/curseforge512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fcrystalspider\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/d559b544-474c-4109-b861-1b2e6ca6026a.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting\"></a></p></p>",
